  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4013,
      "text": "And We restored his family to him and the like of them[18] as a mercy from Us and as a reminder for people of understanding.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 456,
      "ruku": 394,
      "hizbQuarter": 182,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4014,
      "text": "[We said], “Take a bunch of grass in your hand, and strike [your wife] with it, and do not break your oath[19].” We truly found him patient – an excellent and faithful slave he was. He constantly turned [to Us].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 456,
      "ruku": 394,
      "hizbQuarter": 182,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4015,
      "text": "Remember Our slaves: Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob – men of strength and insight.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 456,
      "ruku": 394,
      "hizbQuarter": 182,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4016,
      "text": "We chose them exclusively for the remembrance of the Final Home.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 456,
      "ruku": 394,
      "hizbQuarter": 182,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4017,
      "text": "Indeed, they are before us among the chosen and best ones.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 456,
      "ruku": 394,
      "hizbQuarter": 182,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4018,
      "text": "Also remember Ishmael, Elisha, and Dhul-Kifl[20] – all were among the best.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 456,
      "ruku": 394,
      "hizbQuarter": 182,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4019,
      "text": "This is a reminder. And the righteous will surely have a good return:",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 456,
      "ruku": 394,
      "hizbQuarter": 182,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4020,
      "text": "Gardens of Eternity, with gates wide open for them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 456,
      "ruku": 394,
      "hizbQuarter": 182,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4021,
      "text": "They will recline therein, calling for abundant fruit and drink.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 456,
      "ruku": 394,
      "hizbQuarter": 182,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4022,
      "text": "And they will have maidens of modest gaze[21] and equal age.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 456,
      "ruku": 394,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4023,
      "text": "This is what you are promised for the Day of Account.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 53,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 456,
      "ruku": 394,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4024,
      "text": "Indeed, this is Our provision [for the righteous] that will never cease.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 54,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 456,
      "ruku": 394,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4025,
      "text": "This [is so]. But the transgressors will surely have the worst return:",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 55,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 456,
      "ruku": 394,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4026,
      "text": "Hell, where they will burn. What a terrible resting place!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 56,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 456,
      "ruku": 394,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4027,
      "text": "Let them taste this: scalding water and pus,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 57,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 456,
      "ruku": 394,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4028,
      "text": "and other similar [torments] of various kinds.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 58,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 456,
      "ruku": 394,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4029,
      "text": "[The misleaders will say], “Here is a crowd of people being thrown in with you. They are not welcome! They will surely burn in the Fire.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 59,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 456,
      "ruku": 394,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4030,
      "text": "They will say, “No! You are not welcome! You brought this on us. What a terrible place to settle in!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 60,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 456,
      "ruku": 394,
      "hizbQuarter": 183,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4031,
      "text": "They will say, “Our Lord, whoever brought this on us, give him double punishment in the Fire.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
